{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From the creators of Synth Riders comes <strong>FINAL FURY</strong>, a VR fighting game that redefines stepping into the ring. Face off against the galaxy\u2019s fiercest fighters\u2014offline or across the world with rollback netcode. This isn\u2019t some button-pushing battle. Every punch, every block, and every special attack is powered by YOU.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FINAL FURY</strong> is more than a fighting game\u2014this is a<strong> VR</strong> fighting game, done right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u200e\u3164</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782760/extras/steam_loop_fighter.gif?t=1744120220\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782760/extras/headline1.png?t=1744120220\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd4a\u00a0 <strong>Feel like a fighter</strong> as YOU step into the arena. It\u2019s a first-person throw-down!<br><br>\ud83e\udd4a<strong> Innovative VR combat</strong>, combining arcade fighting mechanics with physical gameplay.<br><br>\ud83e\udd4a<strong> Expanding roster</strong>, each fighter boasting unique move sets, arenas, and personalities to match your play style!\u2028<br><br>\ud83e\udd4a<strong> Spar Solo </strong>against a CPU built to push you. Train hard, work up a sweat, and build up your endurance then go for intergalactic glory!<br><br>\ud83e\udd4a<strong> Compete Online </strong>with cross-platform play and rollback netcode. Get ready to take on the competition, no excuses here!<br><br>\ud83e\udd4a <strong>Break a Sweat</strong> while delivering a beatdown!<br><br>\ud83e\udd4a<strong> Heart-pumping OST</strong> composed by Zardonic (SUPERHOT: MIND CONTROL DELETE).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782760/extras/steam_lineup.png?t=1744120220\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782760/extras/headline2.png?t=1744120220\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FINAL FURY</strong> isn\u2019t just about picking a fighter and learning their moves\u2014BECOME the fighter! Feel the adrenaline as you unleash your FINAL FURY in immersive VR battles where you are the hero. Whether you\u2019re rushing down, footsie-ing, or action-canceling your way to victory, <strong>FINAL FURY</strong>\u2019s skill curve is easy to pick up and tough to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782760/extras/steam_loop_epic.gif?t=1744120220\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782760/extras/headline3.png?t=1744120220\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience fierce fights while coming to blows in first person, then get pumped as ground-pounding finishers and grapples unfold in cinematic third-person perspective cuts. All this explodes around you while battling to the adrenaline-soaked soundtrack from Zardonic (SUPERHOT: MIND CONTROL DELETE)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782760/extras/steam_social_1.png?t=1744120220\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join the official<strong> FINAL FURY</strong> Discord to learn more about community tournaments, the latest FINAL FURY news, and insights straight from the dev team! This fight\u2019s just getting started!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782760/extras/steam_social_2.png?t=1744120220\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1782760?t=1744120220","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782760/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744120220","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782760/c8e8cf1fc6e82ac96f669095f6b41a05e7ff5fcf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744120220","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782760/c8e8cf1fc6e82ac96f669095f6b41a05e7ff5fcf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744120220","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From the creators of Synth Riders comes <strong>FINAL FURY</strong>, a VR fighting game that redefines stepping into the ring. Face off against the galaxy\u2019s fiercest fighters\u2014offline or across the world with rollback netcode. This isn\u2019t some button-pushing battle. Every punch, every block, and every special attack is powered by YOU.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FINAL FURY</strong> is more than a fighting game\u2014this is a<strong> VR</strong> fighting game, done right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u200e\u3164</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782760/extras/steam_loop_fighter.gif?t=1744120220\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782760/extras/headline1.png?t=1744120220\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e